  "summary": "Pause is added in src/main.ts and typechecks. I didn't run `render` after this change or press P in a browser, so the behaviour is untested. P toggles pause while the game is `playing`. While paused, the slab and falling pieces stop, and Space and canvas clicks do nothing. The HUD status shows \"Paused\", and `window.__TASK_STATE__` now includes `paused: boolean`. R restarts and clears the pause. P does nothing once the game is `won` or `lost`. The camera keeps easing toward its target while paused."
